Append a `<tr>` to the Decision Log table's `<tbody>`.

```html
<!-- Before -->
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <!-- endregion:decisions -->
```
```html
<!-- After -->
          <tr>
            <td class="log-table__date">2026-05-12</td>
            <td>The decision in 5-10 words</td>
            <td>The rationale in 1-2 sentences.</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>
    <!-- endregion:decisions -->
```

